Subject: [PATCH] ci(sync-keys): drop the duplicated SYNC_KEYS comment left by
 #173/#175

#173 removed the DATABASE_URL names from SYNC_KEYS and explained why in a
comment. The older, unqualified "Every key the deployed code (Backend/,
Integrations/) reads." line survived the merge directly beneath it, so the env
block stated two contradictory things about the same list -- the first saying
database URLs are deliberately excluded, the second implying a complete list.

The accurate, newer paragraph is kept.

Comment-only: no key, schedule, job or script changes. actionlint 1.7.12 with
shellcheck 0.11.0 reports 0 errors across all 9 workflows.

This identity has no `workflows` permission, so the change is handed over as a
patch file; see project/reports/2026-10-18-failing-checks-diagnosis.md (6.1).
